,{\"children\":\" these aren't the type you eat. They're actually a small data file sent from a server to your web browser or mobile device, then stored in your browser cache or device memory. There are ways you can control your cookie preferences and set whether you want to accept or reject cookies (see what your options are below).\"}]\n15:[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Browser storage:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" some of the data we describe in this policy isn't a traditional cookie at all, it's stored using your browser's \"}],[\"$\",\"strong\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"localStorage\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"3\",{\"children\":\" or held only in page memory. This data never leaves your browser and is never transmitted to our servers.\"}]]}]]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"section\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\",\"children\":\"2. What do we do with these technologies?\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"We use these tracking technologies for a few general purposes:\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"To allow our sites and product application to function correctly, including keeping you securely logged in to your workspace.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"To understand how our marketing site is performing and to inform improvements to our content and user experience.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"To enhance your experience on our sites and provide functionality, for example, so you don't have to reset your interface preferences each time you visit.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-muted\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"To gather relevant, aggregated data that helps us measure marketing performance and the content that's relevant to your interests.\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"We sometimes partner with trusted third-party services that use their own tracking technologies to provide certain features on our site, such as analytics, on-site messaging, or scheduling. These third-party services may use cookies to anonymously collect data and allow them to recognize your computer or mobile device each time you visit any of our sites. No personally identifiable information is collected by these cookies for our own use, and the anonymous data they collect is kept separate from any personal information about you that we collect directly.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"section\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\",\"children\":\"3. The categories of cookies we use\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Here's a breakdown of how we classify the cookies, scripts, and local storage mechanisms across our sites:\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"overflow-x-auto rounded-[14px] border border-line\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full min-w-[560px] border-collapse text-left text-[14px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[#fbfbfd]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-line px-4 py-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted\",\"children\":\"Category\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-line px-4 py-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted\",\"children\":\"What it does\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-line px-4 py-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted\",\"children\":\"Lifespan\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-line\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 align-top leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Strictly Necessary\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 align-top leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Keeps you logged in to app.pyngyn.ai, protects against CSRF and DDoS, and runs core UI features on the marketing site (promo timers, offer countdowns, roadmap votes). Always active, cannot be disabled.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 align-top leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Session-based or short-lived\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-line\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 align-top leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Functional\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 align-top leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Remembers your dashboard preferences, dark mode, sidebar state, default workspace view, and language selection.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 align-top leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Persistent, until cleared\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-line\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 align-top leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Analytics & Performance\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 align-top leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Google Tag Manager and Google Analytics (GA4) on our marketing site, page views, load times, error rates, and referral paths. Aggregated and anonymized; blocked until you consent.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 align-top leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Up to 1 year\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 align-top leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Marketing & Targeting\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 align-top leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Meta/Facebook Pixel, deployed via GTM on the marketing site only, to measure campaign performance and conversions. Never used inside app.pyngyn.ai. Disabled until you consent.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 align-top leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Varies by provider\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"section\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\",\"children\":\"4. Third-party integrations on our sites\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Calendly (Demo bookings)\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"When you visit our \"}],[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"/demo\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"2\",{\"children\":\" scheduling page to book time with our team, Calendly powers the booking experience. Calendly may set its own cookies to secure the booking form, prevent duplicate submissions, and remember your selected time slot. Information you submit there (such as your name, email, and meeting time) goes directly to our Calendly account and does not pass through Pyngyn's application database. Calendly's use of cookies is governed by its own privacy policy.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Anthropic (AI-powered features)\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"AI-powered features within app.pyngyn.ai (including task generation, support assistance, organizational reporting, workload recommendations, and project insights) send the information you submit to Anthropic, our AI processing partner, to generate outputs. This processing happens transiently; per our current implementation, these submissions are not stored in our own database. Anthropic does not use this exchange to set persistent advertising cookies or trackers on your device.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Google Tag Manager, Google Analytics & Meta Pixel\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"These are loaded only on our public marketing site, and only after you consent through our cookie banner. They are never active inside the authenticated app.pyngyn.ai product.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Google Fonts\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Our sites may load typefaces from Google Fonts. Loading a font can share your IP address with Google as part of that request, in the same way it would for any resource fetched from a third-party server.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"section\",\"4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\",\"children\":\"5. Your options when it comes to cookies, web beacons, and similar technologies\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"You can change your web browser's settings to reflect your cookie preferences. Use these links to find out more information about cookie settings for common browsers:\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2.5 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-ink\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-[9px] h-[5px] w-[5px] flex-none rounded-full bg-mute